From: Wenting Zhang <zephray@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 11:16:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Enable support for SSD2828 bridged screens and optional
 LCD_DE pin

---
 board/sunxi/srgn_splash.c |  18 +-
 board/sunxi/srgn_st7701.c | 362 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 363 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

